24) a magnificent Diamond Marquiee Ring £3/ ; (599) a lovely Pearl and Diamond Ring, magnificent quality, £25 ; (596) Diamond and Emerald Half-hoop, £7 ; (102) Diamond and Turquoise Half-hoop ; (648) Lady's Five-stone Opal Half-hoop. 18-et. gold setting, 259 ; (453) Lady's Five-stone Half-hoop Diamond Ring, £5 16s ; (468) ditto, £sss ; (578), ditto. £7 10s ; (187) ditto, £9 9s ; (651) ditto, £l2 lOs ; (447) Gent's Single-stone Old- Brazilian Diamond Ring. £27 lOs ; (Ill) ditto, £35 ; (89), ditto, £3O ; (589), ditto, £l6 10. ; (153), a Circular Diamoud Pendant, to form brooch, composed of the purest Brazilian Diamonds, a rare bargain, £55; (700) lovely Diamond Star, Brooch or Pendant, £3B 10s (555) another, £25 ; (3:8) pretty Diamond Ruby and Pearl Crescent Brooch, £7; (101) Unique Carved Opal Brooch, £2O ; (750) a Regal Oriental Pearl and Diamond Necklace, £200; (117); Opal and Diamond Bracelet, fashionable style, £35 (:04) Diamond and Sapphire Cluster Bracelet, £l7 lOs (165) Diamond and Ruby, 15ct. geld, stylish, £5; pretty Pearl Bracelets. from £1 lOs ; a large selection of Bracelets, all genuine forfeited pledges ; (1.176) Gent's eyold Allert. Govern`ment stamped each link, graduated curb pattern, very massive, £5, (1,109) ditto, £4 17s 6d ; (118) ditto,22 158; '1,334) ditto, £3 3s ; (1,177) ditto. £2 106 ; (1,318) Gent's Fashionable Fetter-link pattern, £2 14s ; (1,299) ditto, £4 ss; (1.317) £2 10s ; (1.320) £2 13s ; (1,168) Gent's handsome fancy pattern £2 156 ; (124) £2 17s 6d ; (282) £2 10s ; (1,204) £2 5s ; (1.291) Gent's Solid Gold Curb Albert £1 bs, marvel- lous value.</p>
