        <p>KEATING'S POWDER. KEATING'S roWDE KEATINGS POWD R.</p>
        <p>Kills. Fleas, Bugs, Moths, Beetles. Kills Fleas. Bugs, Moths, Beetles. Kills Fleas, Bugs, Moths, Beetles. Kills Fleas, Bugs, Moths, Beetles. NEW BELLOWS, 9d.,; Tins 3d., 6d., 1/- NEW BELLOWS, 9d.; Tins. 3d., 6d., 1/- NEW BELLOWS, 9d,; Tins, 3d., 6d., 1/-</p>
