        <p>P. W. L. D. For Agst. Pts Wrexham 9 5 ... 2 ... 2 ... 21 ... 9 ... 12 Bangor Chirk 6 ... 5 ... 1 ... 0 ... 20 ...10 ...10 Osssestry Tranmere Rover.' 9 ... 3 ... 4 ... 2 ... 12 ...13 ... 8 Rhyl Buckley 7 3 3 . 1 13 ...14 ... 7 White Star Wanderers 6 2 2 . 2 11 ... 6 Hudson's Birkenhead Warrington Newton-le-WillowA ---1 ...6 2 .. 14 ...30 ... 4</p>
