      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1900-12-07_WidnesExaminer_art0111" n="art0111">
        <head>" HOME " AGAIN.</head>
        <p>" HOME " AGAIN.</p>
        <p>The charms of " Rome " ers wish us. wherever fluty or pleasure calls, whether in peacqul occupations, or in the stern neeessities of war. How intensely precious must " Home" be to those who are returning from the ShMSTIPA and hardships endured in South Africa. Think of the sick and wounded invalided " Home," to the care of mother. wife, or friends, who ard only too anxious to have their dear ones with them again, to nurse them back into rt new life of perfect haalth and strength. At euch a time, the great recuperative Tonic is Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters. It gives power to the weak limbs, it steadies the nerves, brightens the eye, infuses new hope, and builds up the system anew. Many patients that have been suffering from Enteric and other wagtine disease&amp; simply require to be systematically treated with a tonic restorative. A nomplete rest and a require. In Gwilym Evans' reviving tonic. is all they Quinine Bitters, this will be found in its highest perfec- tion. The Best Remedy for Loss of. Anretite. Indigestion. Impure Blood, Chest Diseases. and Influenza." DON'T LOSE TIME.</p>
        <p>People are continually wondering where to g 0 for some new remedy, when they feel" Out of sorts," " Not up to the mark." or "only Middling." We gay "Don't go." come and get the well-tried and proved Remedy Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters. Do you suffer from Indigestion? Do you feel "Tired " at your work? If so, take Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters and you will soon be right again. Chroule safferers are sometimes averse to be always channieg their medicine, and rightly so, hut it does happen At times that a change would lead to a better state of thine. For instance, if you are suffering from extreme weakness, and are gradually making up your mind to a proloneed illness, you are making a great mistake if you have not tried Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters. Will you try it ? Don't lose time. It is the hest remedy for General Debility, Low Spirits. and NPTVOURIPSS. Its tonic qualities infuse new life, and you soon see the sunny side of nature again, and cheerful content comes with a gradual vain of strength. For Chest Affections, and to guard off Influenza, try ',lle excellent vegetable tonic restorative. Be sure that you get it, when you ask for it. Don't buy worthless imitatione. Say you want Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters, and see that the name" Gwilym Evans' "IS on the label, on the stamp, and on the bottle, without which none are genuine. Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters is sold in bottles. 24 91 and 4s 61 each. by Chemists and Patent Medicine Vendors, or will be sent, carriage free, direct from The Sole Proprietors : Quinine Bitters Manufacturing Company, Limited, Llanelly. South Wales:</p>
