        <p>NEWTON URBAN DISTRICT COUNCIL.</p>
        <p>The Recent, Water Stoppage.</p>
        <p>The monthly meeting of this authorit,y was held in the Town Hall, Earlcstown, on Moaday afternoon, Mc W Collingwood presiding. There were also present Messrs CB F Borron, J W Emmett, N Sid&amp;ley, J Simpson. E T Evans, E L Bent, T Ormand, F J Wood, W Thompson, W Gilmour, Dr Patterson, A Smith, A Bowes (surveyor), W H Lloyd (water engineer) and C Cole (clerk).</p>
      </div>
